# Every key once at P2 0 (clean: band-limited pulse, smooth triangle, 16 bits), P1 255.
tempo 240
steps 96
tail 2.0
track perc
param p1 255 0
param p2 0 0
note 0 F3 1 127
note 4 Gb3 1 127
note 8 G3 1 127
note 12 Ab3 1 127
note 16 A3 1 127
note 20 Bb3 1 127
note 24 B3 1 127
note 28 C4 1 127
note 32 Db4 1 127
note 36 D4 1 127
note 40 Eb4 1 127
note 44 E4 1 127
note 48 F4 1 127
note 52 Gb4 1 127
note 56 G4 1 127
note 60 Ab4 1 127
note 64 A4 1 127
note 68 Bb4 1 127
note 72 B4 1 127
note 76 C5 1 127
note 80 Db5 1 127
note 84 D5 1 127
note 88 Eb5 1 127
note 92 E5 1 127
expect sound 0 96
expect idle 110
expect peak_below -6
